OL,3,GNEWSAHow Milan inspired Cherries' red
OL,4,Aand black stripes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere will be black and red in every
OL,7,Fstand at Bournemouth's Vitality Stadium
OL,8,Flater when AC Milan meet the Cherries
OL,9,Fin the Europa League.
OL,11,FAFC Bournemouth's stripes bear more
OL,12,Fthan a passing resemblance to those of
OL,13,Fthe Italian club, and the similarity is
OL,14,Fno coincidence.
OL,16,FIn 1970, club bosses were looking to
OL,17,Finject a bit of magic back into their
OL,18,Frelegated side and a new kit was
OL,19,Flaunched.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
