OL,3,GNEWSAHow Milan inspired Cherries' red
OL,4,Aand black stripes
OL,5,
OL,6,FClub historian Neil Vacher said
OL,7,Fincoming manager John Bond and chairman
OL,8,FHarold Walker believed the colours of
OL,9,F1969 European champions AC Milan would
OL,10,Fhelp foster a new mentality.
